{"id": "x008-003", "text": "Ines said her mum's hip replacement went fine, she's home now but can't do stairs for a few weeks so they've moved a bed into the living room. Her mum's bored out of her mind, misses her bridge club. Ines is staying with her the first fortnight then her brother Florin takes over. I should drop some puzzle books round for her mum sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do stairs", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored out of her mind", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses her bridge club", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some puzzle books round for her mum", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-004", "text": "So Mandla's band have a gig at the Fleece early March and he's really nervous about it, first time playing his own stuff. Should go. And remind me to message him good luck that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Fleece", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "x008-009", "text": "Call with Lucy. Her scan results come back sometime next week. She's trying not to think about it. Don't forget to ring her the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan results", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying not to think about it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-010", "text": "Neha loves the Arsenal women's team, has a season ticket, goes with her brother Karan most Sundays. They've been going since it was basically empty, now it sells out. She's got a signed shirt from the Euros squad framed in the hallway. Wants to go to an away game in Europe at some point, maybe Barcelona if they draw them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Neha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal women's team", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a season ticket", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most Sundays"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since it was basically empty"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "signed shirt from the Euros squad", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants to go to an away game in Europe", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "some point"}]}
{"id": "x008-011", "text": "Karan's birthday's at the end of the month. He's been dropping hints about a new pair of running shoes, the Hokas he keeps going on about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new pair of running shoes, the Hokas", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x008-014", "text": "Talked to Caitlin about the book club. She's reading the new Sally Rooney and hated it so far, says nothing happens. Next meet is sometime next week at hers, and she wants us to pick something lighter for December, maybe a crime novel. Her mum is coming to stay that weekend so she might move it to the Thursday. Need to finish the book before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "book club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next meet", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "December"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the book", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-015", "text": "Elena mentioned her dad had a fall, broke his wrist. He's in a cast for six weeks. I should send her something, maybe flowers for him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke his wrist", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x008-018", "text": "Ivan's surgery got called off, the surgeon was ill. Rescheduled for early December now. He's fed up waiting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x008-019", "text": "Florin brought his new puppy to the park, a beagle called Biscuit. Biscuit has her jabs at the vet next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beagle called Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "jabs at the vet", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x008-020", "text": "Rachel asked if I can water her plants while she's in hospital. She goes in on the 14th for the hysterectomy and expects to be out a few days after, then signed off for six weeks. I'm doing Tuesday and Friday, her sister does the weekend. She's nervous about the anaesthetic more than anything. Remind me to text her the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's in hospital"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the anaesthetic", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d8", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-022", "text": "Tamar told me Tunde's mum passed away last weekend. Funeral is end of the month. Must send Tunde a card and maybe drop food round before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tamar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Tunde a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop food round", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "x008-025", "text": "jasmine doing the half marathon in the spring, first one ever, training w her partner Graham. she's terrified of the hills. long runs sat mornings, physio for her shin splints the day before each one. said shed love a decent running belt, keeps losing gels. graham doing it too but he's done loads", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of the hills", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat mornings"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "shin splints", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before each one"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent running belt", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "graham", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x008-026", "text": "Aisha's son Hugo got into the county chess team!! starts training sessions in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county chess team", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "training sessions", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "x008-028", "text": "Dong's into vinyl, collects old Motown pressings. Birthday's sometime in early March, keep an eye out at record fairs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old Motown pressings", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep an eye out at record fairs", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "x008-034", "text": "Alfie's dad going in for a heart bypass sometime next week, Alfie's pretty shaken up. I should check in with him afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "heart bypass", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty shaken up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-041", "text": "Akira's wife is expecting, due over the summer. They found out it's a girl. Don't forget to congratulate him properly next time I see him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girl", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "congratulate him properly", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time I see him", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "x008-046", "text": "Tunde rang. Doing okay. Going back to work a week after the funeral, thinks routine will help.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going back to work", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "x008-049", "text": "Long call with Ivan. He's still waiting on the new surgery date, been off work since August and money's tight. Wife Helen is working extra shifts. He's been getting back into chess online to keep his head busy, he's actually pretty good. Says the worst part is not knowing. Need to call him again end of the week and maybe ask if he wants to come round for dinner sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off work", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since August"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "money's tight", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "working extra shifts", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him again", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if he wants to come round for dinner", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "x008-050", "text": "Bianchi family bbq got rained off. Francesca says they'll try again end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Bianchi family bbq", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
